# Response headers for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
# NOTE: Vercel does not read this file. The same rules are mirrored in vercel.json,
# which is what the live site is deployed with - change both together.
# GitHub Pages does not read this file.
#
# Deliberately no Content-Security-Policy here: a correct CSP for this site has
# to allow cdnjs (the PDF libraries) and Google's ad and consent endpoints, and a
# wrong one silently breaks the tool or the ads. Add it only if you intend to
# maintain it - see the note in the report.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()

# Static assets rarely change; the HTML itself should always be revalidated so a
# deploy is visible immediately.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
